{"t":"Fibula","s":"fibula-401ea","k":"local","i":"assets/wiki/Fibula_256085.jpg","q":2,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><dl><dd><i>This article is about the village Fibula. For Fibula the character, see Fibula (Character).</i></dd></dl>\n<aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Fibula</h2>\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"map\">\n<img alt=\"Fibula\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" height=\"271\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Fibula_256085.jpg\" width=\"270\"/>\n</figure>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">General Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"ruler\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Ruled by</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Dermot\">Dermot</a> (ordered by <a href=\"#/wiki/King%20Tibianus\">King Tibianus</a>)</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"population\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Population</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">4</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"organization\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Organizations</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">?</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"near\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Nearby places</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Thais\">Thais</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Fibula%20Dungeon\">Fibula Dungeon</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Calcanea\">Calcanea</a></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group\">\n<caption class=\"pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-secondary-background pi-item-spacing\">Local</caption>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"implemented\">Hunting Places</th>\n<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"implemented\">Quests</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"implemented\"><div class=\"geo-toc\"><ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Cyclops%20Camp\">Cyclops Camp</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Fibula%20Dungeon\">Fibula Dungeon</a></li></ul></div></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"implemented\"><div class=\"geo-toc\"><ul><li><a href=\"#/quest/beggar-outfits-quest\">Beggar Outfits Quest</a></li><li><a href=\"#/quest/deeper-fibula-quest\">Deeper Fibula Quest</a></li><li><a href=\"#/quest/shadows-of-yalahar-quest\">Shadows of Yalahar Quest</a></li><li><a href=\"#/quest/the-great-expedition\">The Great Expedition</a></li></ul></div></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"implementation-date\">5.0<br/>June 18, 1999<br/>Beta 5.0</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: Locations <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<p><b>Fibula</b> is a small island and town south-west of <a href=\"#/wiki/Thais\">Thais</a> named after the fibulas, or calf bones, located in the legs. To come from <a href=\"#/wiki/Thais\">Thais</a> to Fibula you must cross the <a href=\"#/wiki/Fibula%20Tunnel\">Fibula Tunnel</a> (<a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32261,32385,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32261, 32385, 7)</a>) or use the second floor teleporter in <a href=\"#/wiki/Knightwatch%20Tower\">Knightwatch Tower</a>.\n</p><p>The people on Fibula rely mainly on fishing, farming, and hunting wildlife to make a living. Locked deep below the surface are many dangerous creatures in the infamous <a href=\"#/wiki/Fibula%20Dungeon\">Fibula Dungeon</a>. Just north of Fibula is another island called <a href=\"#/wiki/Calcanea\">Calcanea</a> that used to be inhabited by humans, but one day a <a href=\"#/wiki/Giant%20Spider\">Giant Spider</a> came to the surface and killed them all. Everyone who lives on Fibula fears the same thing may happen to them one day. There have also been reports of a great sea monster in the bay just north of Fibula.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-NPCs\">NPCs</span></h2>\n<table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><caption>Fibula NPCs (5 NPCs)</caption><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th class=\"npc-animation\" style=\"width: 128px; text-align: center;\"></th><th style=\"width: 110px; text-align: center;\">Job</th><th style=\"width: 72px; text-align: center;\">Buy/Sell</th><th style=\"\">Location</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 100px;\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Dermot\">Dermot</a></td><td class=\"npc-animation\" style=\"width: 128px; text-align: center; line-height: 64px;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Dermot\"><img alt=\"Dermot\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Dermot_dfc987.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></td><td style=\"width: 110px; text-align: center;\">Representative</td><td style=\"width: 72px; text-align: center;\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></td><td style=\"\">Western <strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Fibula</strong> village</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 100px;\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Eddy\">Eddy</a></td><td class=\"npc-animation\" style=\"width: 128px; text-align: center; line-height: 64px;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Eddy\"><img alt=\"Eddy\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Eddy_b7a084.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></td><td style=\"width: 110px; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Furniture%20Shopkeeper%20NPCs\">Furniture Shopkeeper</a></td><td style=\"width: 72px; text-align: center;\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></td><td style=\"\"><strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Fibula</strong>, by the village gate</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 100px;\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Ferryman%20Kamil\">Ferryman Kamil</a></td><td class=\"npc-animation\" style=\"width: 128px; text-align: center; line-height: 64px;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Ferryman%20Kamil\"><img alt=\"Ferryman Kamil\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Ferryman_Kamil_495c84.gif\" width=\"105\"/></a></span></td><td style=\"width: 110px; text-align: center;\">Ferryman</td><td style=\"width: 72px; text-align: center;\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></td><td style=\"\">Southern <strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Fibula</strong> and Meluna, here.</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 100px;\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Simon%20the%20Beggar\">Simon the Beggar</a></td><td class=\"npc-animation\" style=\"width: 128px; text-align: center; line-height: 64px;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Simon%20the%20Beggar\"><img alt=\"Simon the Beggar\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Simon_the_Beggar_4e48e9.gif\" width=\"119\"/></a></span></td><td style=\"width: 110px; text-align: center;\">Beggar</td><td style=\"width: 72px; text-align: center;\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></td><td style=\"\">Southern <strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Fibula</strong> Shore.</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 100px;\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Timur\">Timur</a></td><td class=\"npc-animation\" style=\"width: 128px; text-align: center; line-height: 64px;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Timur\"><img alt=\"Timur\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Timur_08aeea.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></td><td style=\"width: 110px; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Shopkeeper%20NPCs\">Shopkeeper</a></td><td style=\"width: 72px; text-align: center;\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></td><td style=\"\">Central shop on <strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Fibula</strong></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><br/>\n</p></div>","quests":["shadows-of-yalahar-quest","the-great-expedition"]}